    "sentence_translations": [
      "To Strike Up a Conversation",
      "",
      "On the nonstop flight to Beijing, a handsome guy sat beside Little Zhang.",
      "Little Zhang really wanted to strike up a conversation with him, but also didn’t know what to say.",
      "Little Zhang thought for quite a while, finally summoned up courage, and asked:",
      "“Handsome guy, are you also going to Beijing?”",
      "",
      "That handsome guy looked at Little Zhang, and said with a smile:",
      "“We’re on the same flight. If I wasn’t going to Beijing, do you expect me to jump off midway?”"
    ]
